   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Off The Record** (1 review): The first song was a Prince cover, which was not captured on the tape [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2005-06-30mk41.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 6 songs; 43 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- My Morning Jacket opened for Wilco, arriving fifteen minutes early and missing the first song [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2005-06-30mk41.flac16**: source: Schoeps mk41> kc5> cmc6xt> Sonosax SX-M2> mod. SBM-1> D8 @ 44.1k, FOB/DIN, Row L [1]. Also: The recording is missing the first song, identified as a Prince cover [1]",
